---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ArticleNav from '../../components/ArticleNav.astro';

import heroPortrait from '../../assets/images/03-azorean-blues-conversation/romeu-bairos-portrait-with-viola-da-terra.jpg';
import violaCloseUp from '../../assets/images/03-azorean-blues-conversation/romeu-bairos-viola-da-terra-close-up.jpg';
import romeuPlaying from '../../assets/images/03-azorean-blues-conversation/romeu-bairos-playing-viola-da-terra-tropical-plants.jpg';

const edition = await getEntry('editions', 'edition-2');
const purchaseUrl = edition?.data.purchase_url ?? '#';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Azorean Blues -- Ilh&eacute;u Magazine"
  description="Conversation 3: Azorean Blues. Diogo Lima and Romeu Bairos on folk music, the viola da terra, and imagining an Azorean blues."
>

  <ArticleNav next={{ label: "Playlist", href: "/playlists/azorean-blues" }} />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-12 md:pt-28 md:pb-16">

      <!-- Category label -->
      <p class="font-inter text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-gray-400 mb-8">
        Conversation 3 &mdash; Music
      </p>

      <!-- Title -->
      <h1 class="font-cardo text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.05] text-gray-900 max-w-4xl">
        Azorean Blues
      </h1>

      <!-- Credits -->
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-1">
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-gray-500">
          By Diogo Lima &amp; Romeu Bairos
        </p>
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-gray-400">
          Photographs by Maria Abranches
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Hero image: Romeu portrait with viola da terra -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      <figure>
        <Image
          src={heroPortrait}
          alt="Romeu Bairos with his viola da terra"
          class="w-full h-auto"
          widths={[600, 900, 1200]}
          sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 900px"
        />
        <figcaption class="font-body text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Romeu Bairos with his viola da terra. Photograph by Maria Abranches
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Opening context -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
      <p class="font-cardo text-lg sm:text-xl leading-[1.8] text-gray-800">
        The blues is one of the foundations of modern music &mdash; rock, jazz, country, and so many more musical genres trace their lineage back to it. Beyond the American South, however, other cultures developed their own sorrow songs: fado in Portugal, the Greek rebetiko, or the Ethiopian tezeta.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Viola da terra close-up -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pb-20 md:pb-28">
      <figure>
        <Image
          src={violaCloseUp}
          alt="Close-up of a viola da terra, the Azorean twelve-string guitar"
          class="w-full h-auto"
          widths={[600, 900, 1200]}
          sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 800px"
        />
        <figcaption class="font-body text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          The viola da terra, the Azorean twelve-string guitar. Photograph by Maria Abranches
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Romeu -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-16 md:pb-24">
      <p class="font-cardo text-lg sm:text-xl leading-[1.8] text-gray-800">
        Romeu Bairos continues that lineage, though never by simply going back to basics. On <em>Rom&ecirc; das Furnas</em>, he reinterprets forgotten folk songs and adds new ones of his own, all anchored by the viola da terra, the Azorean twelve-string guitar that remains at the heart of the islands&rsquo; sound.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Warm accent section with key insight -->
  <section class="bg-stone-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
      <blockquote class="font-cardo text-xl sm:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-gray-600 italic border-l-2 border-stone-300 pl-8">
        &ldquo;What makes Bairos singular is the way he seems to inhabit the very traits of the songs he sings. Restless, sometimes fatalistic, and with a hint of cheekiness here and there, he embodies the bluesy undertones of the Azorean spirit rather than treating them as raw material for bland pop fusion.&rdquo;
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Romeu playing amid tropical plants -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
      <figure>
        <Image
          src={romeuPlaying}
          alt="Romeu Bairos playing the viola da terra amid tropical plants"
          class="w-full h-auto"
          widths={[600, 900, 1200]}
          sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 800px"
        />
        <figcaption class="font-body text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Photograph by Maria Abranches
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Framing -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-20 md:pb-28">
      <p class="font-cardo text-lg sm:text-xl leading-[1.8] text-gray-800">
        It is in this speculative spirit &mdash; halfway between history, invention, and personal expression &mdash; that our conversation unfolded: on what it might mean to imagine an &lsquo;Azorean blues.&rsquo;
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-28 md:pb-36 text-center">
      <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-16">
        <p class="font-cardo text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-500 mb-6">
          Read the full conversation in Ilh&eacute;u Magazine Issue B
        </p>
        <a
          href={purchaseUrl}
          class="inline-block font-inter text-sm tracking-wide uppercase text-gray-900 border border-gray-900 px-8 py-3 hover:bg-gray-900 hover:text-white transition-colors"
        >
          Buy Issue B
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ArticleNav next={{ label: "Playlist", href: "/playlists/azorean-blues" }} />

</BaseLayout>
